{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"plan\": \"全曲主线从“想靠近却不敢”开始，经过对方没有退开、亲近逐渐加深、心意意外暴露，再走向主动承认喜欢，最后接受无法保证永远。前后呼应“靠近与退开”“藏着与说出口”“舍不得与不再强求”：开头的谨慎在中段变成热烈，短暂的孤单又被对方没有改变的态度安抚；后半段喜欢不再藏着，却也越来越清楚地意识到时间和未来无法控制。S01、S05、S09、S11、S13、S14以线推动关键变化；S02–S04、S06–S08、S10、S12则让不同的身体感觉、画面、心里话和听法充分散开。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他忽然想靠近，又怕对方觉得负担太重。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"想靠近\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-1\", \"S01-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"两下和弦突然\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"夏夜烟花\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"直冲高处\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"碎光点点\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"慢慢飘落\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"落了还没稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悬在水面上\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"船歌摇荡未成形\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一脚踏上小船\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"木板微微晃\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波从脚下荡开\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体忽然一轻\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像是失了重\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"声音还悬在空中\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"刚踩上船板\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没安稳摇起来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"这点亲近虽甜，他还不敢把喜欢说透。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"说透\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"话还没出口\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"几秒钟沉默\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想了很久的话\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里早已清楚\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一说出口就会变\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"关系可能改变\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"格外小心\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"对方没有退开，他才敢慢慢放松下来。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"没有退开\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"肩挨着肩\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"耳边低语\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸贴得很近\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"体温都融在一起\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不用拼命找话题\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"偶尔望来一眼\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默也不紧张\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"夏末的湿热微风\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"裹在皮肤上\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"黏黏的\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"歌声还没浮出来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"左手先像心跳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一下一下摇着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"无尽的水浪\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下不用踩实\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体交给船底\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"舒服地漂着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暂时不急靠岸\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水一直在流\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"时间也一直走\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他想再靠近，却怕太急，也舍不得这一刻。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"舍不得\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-2\", \"S02-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"歌声忽然往上涌\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"感情热了一下\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸跟着变了\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没有冲到高潮\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻轻呼出一口气\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"重新柔和下来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"短暂落稳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又轻轻漂起\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心事没说死\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"柔软的落音\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"甜蜜的确认\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里有根小刺\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"鼻子一酸\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"眼前的好还在\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没失去\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"已经舍不得\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"希望慢一点\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"},\n            {\"text\": \"这一刻再久些\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"7–11\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他暂时不想以后，只想安静待在这份亲近里。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"不想以后\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"歌声退到后面\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一阵阵流动\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"绕着盘旋\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波般摇晃\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体轻轻漂着\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暂时不去哪里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还沉在那句话里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有点陶醉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有点走神\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默也舒服\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体还在这里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心已经漂远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"想告诉对方的喜欢，到了嘴边又淡了。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"嘴边又淡了\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"短促又急切\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忽然冒出几句\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"念头露了个头\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"很快又沉下去\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没变成倾诉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波还在晃\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"流动却受牵绊\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像被暗流拖住\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"绕了远路\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"停在半途\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"风吹碎的倒影\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"粼粼闪烁\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"难以拼完整\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"谈话碰到难处\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"顺畅里有了阻力\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"熟悉的亲近又回来，他几乎想把心意说开。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"心意说开\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"欢喜\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-1\", \"S04-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉的歌声回来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"肩挨着肩\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"耳边低语\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸贴得很近\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"比上次更华丽\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"比上次更急切\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水面折射的光斑\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"亮得睁不开眼\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"微笑着讲往事\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"语速忽然变快\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忍不住再说一遍\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又折回来补细节\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"怕说得太多让对方为难，他还是留了些。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"留了些\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"高处长颤音\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"夕阳最后一道金光\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"亮得刺眼\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"情绪一下烧热\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"话到喉咙口\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"喉咙发颤\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像要哽咽\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"右手悬在高处\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波还推着走\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"情绪一下打开\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"往上冲又收弱\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没能稳稳落下\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"30–34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"话还在空气里\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"摇晃慢下来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"人也安静了\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"34\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻轻握着手\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不知不觉握紧\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"动作先露了怯\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想把人抱紧\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"牢牢抓住当下\", \"bead\": \"S04-B3